DESCRIPTION >
    Final 2xx and 5xx outcomes per requested model and hour, for catalog
    health. `recent` keeps the hour's latest 50 such requests, newest first,
    so the community feed merges a last-50 sample without scanning events.
    Eight days covers the seven-day community window.

SCHEMA >
    `hour` DateTime,
    `model` LowCardinality(String),
    `event_type` LowCardinality(String),
    `status_2xx` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    `errors_5xx` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    `recent` AggregateFunction(groupArraySorted(50), Tuple(Int64, String, UInt32))

ENGINE AggregatingMergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY toYYYYMMDD(hour)
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY model, event_type, hour
ENGINE_TTL hour + toIntervalDay(8)
